.venv/
__pycache__/
# pipeline output: keep the octinoxate results, ignore scratch and test runs
runs/*
!runs/octinoxate/
# Run logs belong beside the results they describe, in runs/<ligand>/logs/, which the line above
# already keeps. This negation is only a safety net for one redirected to runs/ by mistake: never
# ignore a run log, because it is the only record of how long a calculation took, whether it
# converged, and what it printed on the way. Regenerating one means re-running the hours of UMA
# relaxation that produced it.
!runs/*.log
